OL,3,GNEWSABlood cancer patients call for
OL,4,Afaster drug access
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department of Health and Social Care
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "Every patient with
OL,8,Fblood cancer deserves fast access to
OL,9,Fthe best possible treatment, and we are
OL,10,Fdetermined to make that a reality."
